                <pb facs="1278" n="1128" xml:id="pg1128"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Fox to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-05-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 6,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Fox reports that Ecuador will be represented at the Second Peace Conference
                    by Señor Rendon, the Ecuadorean minister to France.)</p>
            </div>
